Runtime dependency under a different license
--------------------------------------------

This package requires gree-hvac-client at runtime, which is licensed under
the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0):

  https://github.com/apachler/gree-hvac-client
  (fork of https://github.com/inwaar/gree-hvac-client)

gree-hvac-client is not included in this package's source or release
tarball; npm installs it as a separate dependency. However, the nodes load
it into the same Node-RED process, so any work that is distributed together
with gree-hvac-client (for example a Node-RED installation, a container
image or an appliance that ships both) must comply with the terms of
GPL-3.0 as a whole. The MIT-licensed code in this repository remains
available under MIT on its own.
